            "path": "Decision Journal/principles/PRINCIPLE-ROLLBACK.md",
            "content": "---\ntype: \"decision-methodology\"\nversion: 1\nid: PRINCIPLE-ROLLBACK\ntitle: \"迁移前验证回退\"\norigin: \"decision_evidence\"\ncreated: \"2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z\"\nupdated: \"2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z\"\nstatus: \"accepted\"\nconfirmed_at: \"2026-09-01T00:00:00.000Z\"\nconfidence: \"low\"\nsource_decisions: [\"synthetic-evidence\"]\ngeneration_request: \"synthetic\"\ngeneration_profile: \"synthetic\"\ngeneration_provider: \"synthetic\"\ngeneration_model: \"synthetic\"\n---\n# 迁移前验证回退\n\n## 原则\n\n<!-- decision:methodology-principle-start -->\n数据库迁移之前先验证回退路径，确保失败时恢复旧数据。\n<!-- decision:methodology-principle-end -->\n\n## 适用条件\n\n<!-- decision:methodology-applies-start -->\n数据库结构迁移且旧数据必须保留。\n<!-- decision:methodology-applies-end -->\n\n## 注意事项\n\n<!-- decision:methodology-caution-start -->\n破坏性迁移必须先备份，无法恢复时停止。\n<!-- decision:methodology-caution-end -->\n\n## 证据摘要\n\n<!-- decision:methodology-evidence-start -->\n合成复盘：回退演练减少迁移失败损失。\n<!-- decision:methodology-evidence-end -->\n"
          }
